('4', '2', 'AI 大模型应用开发实战', 'ai-llm-development-guide', '# AI 大模型应用开发实战本文介绍如何基于大语言模型构建实用的应用程序。## 技术栈- OpenAI GPT-4 / Claude API- LangChain 框架- Vector Database (Pinecone, Milvus)## 开发流程1. **需求分析**：明确应用场景2. **Prompt 工程**：设计高效提示词3. **应用架构**：设计系统流程4. **集成测试**：确保输出质量## 实践案例构建一个智能客服系统，自动回答用户问题并提供解决方案。', '学习如何基于大语言模型构建实用的 AI 应用，包括技术选型、开发流程和实践案例。', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/ai/800/400', 1, 1, '2026-01-20 00:55:32.571', 'AI 大模型应用开发实战 | River Blog', '学习 AI 大模型应用开发，包括 LangChain、Prompt 工程和实际案例', NULL, '150', 0, 'system', '2026-01-20 00:55:32.571086', 1, '2026-01-28 13:15:38.035674', 0, 1),
('3', '2', 'React 19 新特性抢先看', 'react-19-new-features', '# React 19 新特性抢先看React 19 引入了许多令人兴奋的新特性，让我们一起来探索。## 主要特性1. **Actions**：简化异步操作处理2. **use hook**：新的原生 hook3. **资源预加载**：自动预加载资源以提升性能## 代码示例```jsxfunction SearchForm() {    const [query, setQuery] = useState('');    return (        <form action={async (formData) => {            const result = await search(formData);        }}>            <input                type="text"                value={query}                onChange={(e) => setQuery(e.target.value)}            />        </form>    );}```', '探索 React 19 的新特性，包括 Actions、新的 hook 和性能优化。', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/react/800/400', 1, 1, '2026-01-20 00:55:32.571', 'React 19 新特性抢先看 | River Blog', '了解 React 19 的最新特性，包括 Actions 和新的 hook API', NULL, '120', 1, 'system', '2026-01-20 00:55:32.571086', 1, '2026-01-28 13:15:44.790927', 0, 1),
('2', 1, '深入理解 Java 泛型', 'java-generics-deep-dive', '# 深入理解 Java 泛型泛型是 Java 中非常重要的特性，本文将深入探讨其原理和使用技巧。## 什么是泛型泛型允许在编译时检测类型错误，提供类型安全的代码。## 核心概念### 类型参数```javapublic class Box<T> {    private T content;    public void set(T content) { this.content = content; }    public T get() { return content; }}```### 泛型方法```javapublic <T> T[] toArray(T... items) {    return items;}```## 通配符- `<? extends T>`：上界通配符- `<? super T>`：下界通配符- `<?>`：无界通配符', '本文深入探讨 Java 泛型的核心概念，包括类型参数、泛型方法和通配符的使用技巧。', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/java/800/400', 1, 1, '2026-01-20 00:55:32.571', '深入理解 Java 泛型 | River Blog', '学习 Java 泛型的核心概念和使用技巧，包括类型参数、通配符和类型推断', NULL, '80', 0, 'system', '2026-01-20 00:55:32.571086', 1, '2026-01-28 13:15:50.967784', 0, 1),
(1, 1, 'Spring Boot 3.x 快速入门指南', 'spring-boot-3-quick-start', '# Spring Boot 3.x 快速入门Spring Boot 3.x 是 Spring 框架的最新主要版本，带来了许多新特性和改进。## 新特性1. **原生编译支持**：通过 GraalVM 原生镜像，显著提升应用启动速度2. **Jakarta EE 10**：全面支持最新的企业级 Java 标准3. **依赖升级**：所有主要依赖项均已升级到最新稳定版本## 快速开始```java@SpringBootApplicationpublic class DemoApplication {    public static void main(String[] args) {        SpringApplication.run(DemoApplication.class, args);    }}```## 总结Spring Boot 3.x 为现代云原生应用开发提供了强大的支持。', '本文介绍 Spring Boot 3.x 的核心特性和快速入门方法，包括原生编译、Jakarta EE 10 等新功能。', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/springboot/800/400', 1, 1, '2026-01-20 00:55:32.571', 'Spring Boot 3.x 快速入门指南 | River Blog', '学习 Spring Boot 3.x 的核心特性和快速入门方法', NULL, '100', 1, 'system', '2026-01-20 00:55:32.571086', 1, '2026-01-28 13:15:55.700505', 0, 1),
('5', 1, 'Must-Join Affiliate Marketing Events in 2026', 'must-join-affiliate-marketing-events-2026', '## Table of Contents- [Why Attend Affiliate Marketing Events?](#why-attend-affiliate-marketing-events)- [Q1 2026: Start the Year Strong](#q1-2026-start-the-year-strong)- [Q2 2026: Spring Into Action](#q2-2026-spring-into-action)- [Q3 2026: Fall Conferences](#q3-2026-fall-conferences)- [Q4 2026: Year-End Networking](#q4-2026-year-end-networking)- [How to Choose the Right Events](#how-to-choose-the-right-events)- [Conclusion](#conclusion)## Why Attend Affiliate Marketing Events?The affiliate marketing industry thrives on relationships, knowledge sharing, and staying ahead of trends. In-person events offer unparalleled opportunities to connect with potential partners, learn from industry leaders, and discover new tools and strategies.Whether you''re an affiliate publisher, advertiser, network executive, or agency professional, attending the right conferences can significantly impact your business growth. With **over 50 affiliate marketing events** scheduled worldwide in 2026, choosing where to invest your time and budget is crucial.In this guide, we''ll highlight the **must-attend events** for 2026, organized by quarter to help you plan your conference calendar effectively.## Q1 2026: Start the Year Strong### Affiliate Summit West (January 12-14, Las Vegas)**Affiliate Summit West** remains the flagship event for the affiliate marketing industry. Held at **Caesars Forum Las Vegas**, this three-day conference brings together over **7,000 attendees** from around the world.| Detail | Information ||--------|-------------|| **Dates** | January 12-14, 2026 || **Location** | Caesars Forum, Las Vegas, NV || **Expected Attendance** | 7,000+ || **Ticket Price** | $800-2,000 |The event features **seven topic tracks** covering:- Content & Commerce- Lead Generation- Brand Strategy- eCommerce- AI & Technology> **Pro Tip:** Book your hotel early—Vegas fills up fast during ASW. The venue is located through the LINQ promenade, under the High Roller Observation Wheel.![Affiliate Summit West conference hall](https://images.pexels.com/photos/2774556/pexels-photo-2774556.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750)### iGB Affiliate Barcelona (January 20-21)For those in the **iGaming affiliate space**, iGB Affiliate Barcelona is the premier event connecting affiliates, operators, and tech vendors. This focused gathering offers deep insights into the regulated gaming industry.### Affiliate World Dubai (March 4-5)**Affiliate World Dubai** has quickly become a major stop on the global affiliate circuit. With **7,000+ participants** expected, this event focuses on cutting-edge advertising methods.| Track | Focus Area ||-------|------------|| Meta Ads | Facebook & Instagram advertising || Google Ads | Search and display marketing || TikTok | Short-form video advertising || AI-Powered Marketing | Automation and optimization |### TES Affiliate Conference (March 9-12, Marbella)**The European Summit (TES)** takes place at the Hard Rock Hotel Marbella, Spain. Running since 2009, TES attracts **2,000+ attendees** and offers a unique blend of business and networking in a stunning Mediterranean setting.### PI LIVE Level Up Bristol (March 26)This new regional event from the PI LIVE team brings practical, peer-led learning directly to the UK affiliate community. Perfect for affiliate managers, partnership leads, and agency professionals who want focused education without the major conference price tag.![European affiliate marketing conference](https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181406/pexels-photo-1181406.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750)## Q2 2026: Spring Into Action### Affiliate Summit East (July 27-28, New York)**Affiliate Summit East** returns to the **New York Marriott Marquis Times Square**. This mid-year event brings together **4,500+ professionals** including advertisers, publishers, ecommerce sellers, and tech suppliers.| Detail | Information ||--------|-------------|| **Dates** | July 27-28, 2026 || **Location** | Marriott Marquis, Times Square, NYC || **Expected Attendance** | 4,500+ |The New York venue offers excellent networking opportunities with easy access to major brand headquarters and agency offices in the city.## Q3 2026: Fall Conferences### DMEXCO (September 23-24, Cologne)**DMEXCO** (Digital Marketing Exposition & Conference) is Europe''s largest digital marketing trade fair. Held at **Messe Cologne**, this event covers the full spectrum of digital marketing including:- Performance marketing- Affiliate marketing- Search engine marketing- Social media marketing- Mobile marketing- Email marketingWith **40,000+ visitors** and **700+ partner companies**, DMEXCO provides massive exposure to the European digital marketing ecosystem. It''s ideal for those looking to expand their affiliate programs into European markets.### PI LIVE Europe (October 19-21, London)**PI LIVE Europe** evolves into the "**Festival of Partnerships**" in 2026—a reimagined campus experience across Old Billingsgate, The Steel Yard, and additional venues in London.This premier event brings together:- Leading advertisers and brands- Publishers and affiliates- Affiliate networks- Agencies and influencers> **Note:** PI LIVE USA has been paused for 2026, with resources focused on expanding the European event portfolio.![London affiliate marketing conference venue](https://images.pexels.com/photos/7647995/pexels-photo-7647995.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750)## Q4 2026: Year-End Networking### Affiliate World Asia (December 9-10, Bangkok)**Affiliate World Asia** is the year-end finale for the affiliate marketing industry. Held at the **Centara Grand & Bangkok Convention Centre**, this event attracts:- **7,000+ attendees** from 110+ countries- **35+ world-class speakers**- **300+ exhibitors**- **210+ advertisers, traffic sources, and networks**| Detail | Information ||--------|-------------|| **Dates** | December 9-10, 2026 || **Location** | Centara Grand, Bangkok || **Expected Attendance** | 7,000+ || **Content** | 20+ hours across two stages |Bangkok offers excellent value with affordable accommodation and flights, making it an attractive destination for international attendees. The city''s vibrant nightlife and culture also provide memorable networking opportunities outside the conference halls.## How to Choose the Right EventsWith limited time and budget, selecting the right events requires strategic thinking. Consider these factors:### By Your Role| Role | Recommended Events ||------|-------------------|| **Affiliate/Publisher** | Affiliate World events, Affiliate Summit || **Advertiser/Brand** | PI LIVE, DMEXCO, Affiliate Summit || **Network Executive** | All major events for relationship building || **Agency Professional** | PI LIVE, DMEXCO, regional events || **iGaming Focus** | iGB Affiliate Barcelona |### By Your Budget- **Premium ($1,500+):** Affiliate Summit West, Affiliate World events- **Mid-Range ($500-1,500):** PI LIVE, TES, DMEXCO- **Budget-Friendly ($200-500):** Regional events, PI LIVE Level Up### By Geography- **Americas Focus:** Affiliate Summit West & East- **Europe Focus:** PI LIVE Europe, DMEXCO, TES- **Asia-Pacific Focus:** Affiliate World Asia- **Global Coverage:** Affiliate World Dubai![Affiliate marketing professionals networking](https://images.pexels.com/photos/7869014/pexels-photo-7869014.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750)## Conclusion2026 offers an exceptional lineup of affiliate marketing events around the world. From the massive gatherings at **Affiliate Summit** and **Affiliate World** to the focused learning at **PI LIVE** and regional events, there''s something for every professional in the performance marketing space.**Our top recommendations for 2026:**1. **Affiliate Summit West** (January) - The industry''s flagship event2. **Affiliate World Dubai** (March) - Cutting-edge advertising strategies3. **PI LIVE Europe** (October) - The Festival of Partnerships4. **Affiliate World Asia** (December) - Year-end networking in BangkokStart planning now—the best hotels and early-bird tickets sell out months in advance. Mark your calendars, set your budgets, and prepare to make 2026 your most connected year yet.---**Ready to level up your affiliate marketing game?** Start by registering for at least one major event this year. The connections you make and strategies you learn will pay dividends for years to come.', 'Discover the top affiliate marketing conferences and events in 2026 that every affiliate marketer, advertiser, and network professional should attend. From Affiliate Summit to Affiliate World, we cover the essential gatherings for networking, learning, and growing your performance marketing business.', 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/2774556/pexels-photo-2774556.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750', '4', '2', '2026-01-28 12:44:25.821', 'Top Affiliate Marketing Events & Conferences to Attend in 2026', 'Complete guide to the must-attend affiliate marketing events in 2026, including Affiliate Summit, Affiliate World, PI LIVE, and DMEXCO with dates and locations.', NULL, '200', 1, 'system', '2026-01-28 12:44:25.821052', 1, '2026-01-28 13:16:04.906511', 0, 1);
